  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 3.5,
      "text": "This is Nico and he has beef with a trillion dollar industry."
    },
    {
      "s": 3.72,
      "e": 5.22,
      "text": "It all started when his wife got stuck"
    },
    {
      "s": 5.22,
      "e": 7.36,
      "text": "in a snowstorm 500 miles away."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.7,
      "e": 9.74,
      "text": "We haven't seen each other in a really, really long time"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.74,
      "e": 11.28,
      "text": "and it was Valentine's Day"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.28,
      "e": 13.26,
      "text": "so we missed each other and wanted to spend the weekend."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.54,
      "e": 16.26,
      "text": "But while stranded in the airport, her flight got canceled."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.48,
      "e": 18.74,
      "text": "So Nico started looking for an alternative online"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.74,
      "e": 21.36,
      "text": "and he quickly realized that something was very wrong."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.56,
      "e": 24.02,
      "text": "This is every website and app you need to go on a trip."
    },
    {
      "s": 24.2,
      "e": 26.42,
      "text": "One to book flights, trains, buses, hotels,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.6,
      "e": 28.3,
      "text": "get guide, split bills, message friends,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.3,
      "e": 30.42,
      "text": "hundreds of travel apps and booking websites."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.8,
      "e": 33.12,
      "text": "But when something goes wrong, none of them help you."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.46,
      "e": 35.46,
      "text": "I think the way that the travel industry treats"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.92,
      "e": 38.7,
      "text": "the customers is almost purely transactional."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.8,
      "e": 40.76,
      "text": "So they see you as a flight number"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.76,
      "e": 42.54,
      "text": "or a hotel booking reservation."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.82,
      "e": 44.42,
      "text": "And if something happens along the way,"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.54,
      "e": 45.76,
      "text": "well, good luck reaching someone."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.06,
      "e": 47.92,
      "text": "So Nico thought, what if you could do all of this"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.92,
      "e": 50.2,
      "text": "on one platform that actually cares"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.2,
      "e": 51.76,
      "text": "about getting you to your destination?"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.12,
      "e": 53.9,
      "text": "There needs to be something that just shows you"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.9,
      "e": 56.66,
      "text": "if the one part doesn't work, what else is there?"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.66,
      "e": 58.56,
      "text": "What you get with a var that you don't get"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.56,
      "e": 61.92,
      "text": "with any other platform today is like this calm feeling"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.92,
      "e": 63.42,
      "text": "of you being taken care of."
    },
    {
      "s": 63.44,
      "e": 66.02,
      "text": "So it combines everything from flights to hotels"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.02,
      "e": 69.74,
      "text": "to messaging parts and even group coordination"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.74,
      "e": 71.02,
      "text": "and so much more."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.22,
      "e": 73.24,
      "text": "With his new idea, Nico asked his coworkers"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.24,
      "e": 74.3,
      "text": "at Google what they thought."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.02,
      "e": 77.1,
      "text": "And I was kind of laughed out of the room"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.1,
      "e": 79.48,
      "text": "because the feedback then is I would need millions"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.48,
      "e": 82.18,
      "text": "in funding and a huge team to build it."
    },
    {
      "s": 82.3,
      "e": 83.7,
      "text": "But Nico's idea wasn't impossible."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.0,
      "e": 84.76,
      "text": "He was just early."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.76,
      "e": 87.06,
      "text": "So after waiting 14 years."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.2,
      "e": 88.88,
      "text": "Then I started working more and more with AI"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.88,
      "e": 91.32,
      "text": "and I came across Lovable and then I just thought"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.32,
      "e": 93.2,
      "text": "I just need to give it a chance and I did."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.36,
      "e": 94.18,
      "text": "It's almost like a superpower"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.18,
      "e": 96.8,
      "text": "where I know I can build whatever I want"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.8,
      "e": 99.2,
      "text": "or whatever I need to on a technical scale."
    },
    {
      "s": 99.4,
      "e": 102.2,
      "text": "Var is not a travel platform or a booking app."
    },
    {
      "s": 102.34,
      "e": 103.72,
      "text": "It's an entirely new category."
    },
    {
      "s": 104.04,
      "e": 105.14,
      "text": "I guess the rest is history."
    },
    {
      "s": 105.36,
      "e": 107.84,
      "text": "I've just been building with Lovable ever since."
    }
  ]
}
